{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/pulls/3136","id":2979568309,"node_id":"PR_kwDOLW-eZs6xmJq1","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/3136","diff_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/3136.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/3136.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/3136","number":3136,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[form] Drop `onClearErrors` prop and always clear `errors` on change","user":{"login":"mj12albert","id":4997971,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5OTc5NzE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4997971?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert","html_url":"https://github.com/mj12albert","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mj12albert/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"**Breaking:** Removed `onClearErrors` prop from `<Form>`\r\n\r\nDemo: https://deploy-preview-3136--base-ui.netlify.app/react/components/form#submit-with-a-server-function\r\n\r\nFor all validation modes, it's a better UX to optimistically clear external (server) errors on change without needing to add `onClearErrors={setErrors}`\r\n- Matches [RA](https://react-spectrum.adobe.com/react-aria/forms.html#server-validation:~:text=These%20are%20displayed%20to%20the%20user%20as%20soon%20as%20the%20validationErrors%20prop%20is%20set%2C%20and%20cleared%20after%20the%20user%20modifies%20each%20field%27s%20value)\r\n- Makes `useActionState` viable, compare with [the preview](https://deploy-preview-2983--base-ui.netlify.app/react/components/form#submit-with-a-server-function) of this [PR](https://github.com/mui/base-ui/pull/2983), it would always require an extra state and effect \r\n\r\nAlso frees up the API surface a bit if there's a need to customize revalidation more deeply in the future\r\n\r\nCloses https://github.com/mui/base-ui/issues/2758\r\n\r\n- [x] I have followed (at least) the [PR section of the contributing guide](https://github.com/mui/base-ui/blob/HEAD/CONTRIBUTING.md#sending-a-pull-request).\r\n","created_at":"2025-11-05T09:04:34Z","updated_at":"2025-11-07T07:28:19Z","closed_at":"2025-11-07T07:28:14Z","merged_at":"2025-11-07T07:28:14Z","merge_commit_sha":"10410b0045e5e856402f29ea05b0b73a7ff814a4","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"colmtuite","id":805073,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwNTA3Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/805073?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/colmtuite","html_url":"https://github.com/colmtuite","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colmtuite/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colmtuite/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colmtuite/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colmtuite/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colmtuite/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colmtuite/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colmtuite/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colmtuite/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/colmtuite/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},{"login":"michaldudak","id":4696105,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2OTYxMDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4696105?v=4","gravatar_id